{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105260","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110526001:1":{"text":"いらっしゃいませ！薬草をお探しかい？","source_cn":"客人们，有什么药材需求吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42F96783644E36F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110526002:1":{"text":"あんたが曜砂草を扱ってるって、アクンが……","source_cn":"阿熏让我们来的，说你有曜砂草。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08F2984853AD09F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110526003:1":{"text":"はぁ？またあいつかい！？","source_cn":"咦？他又想要这种草药？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB640FD5711C25175","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110526004:1":{"text":"ダメだ！曜砂草はすごく貴重で、残り僅かしかないんだ。在庫を補充するまでは売るわけにはいかない！","source_cn":"绝对不行！这是我压箱底的库存，在有新货进来之前，绝不会脱手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6499D5A0408DBDC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110526005:1":{"text":"頼む！命に関わることなんだ！","source_cn":"请务必让给我们，现在人命关天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD892EB5652169FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110526006:1":{"text":"だから？この砂漠じゃそんなのは日常茶飯事だよ。もっと納得できる理由がなきゃ、薬草は渡せないね！","source_cn":"所以呢？荒角沙漠每天都在出人命。想要草药，你得给我更好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61BEE18ED294F05A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110526007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、どうすればいい？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7B0178422F59F565","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、どうすればいい？","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、どうすればいい？","variant_male_record_index":"120408","variant_female_record_index":"120409","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1110526007":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、どうすればいい？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，现在怎么办？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7B0178422F59F565","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、どうすればいい？","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、どうすればいい？","variant_male_record_index":"120408","variant_female_record_index":"120409","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110526008:1":{"text":"……妹のアルサが毒で苦しんでいる。助けるには曜砂草が必要なんだ。","source_cn":"……我的妹妹阿尔萨中毒了，她急需曜砂草救命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29E4391C8CAA9E63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110526009:1":{"text":"頼む、どうか薬草を売ってくれ……","source_cn":"求求你，卖给我吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30DB10A14F356C89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110526012:1":{"text":"……分かったよ。そういうことなら、持っていきな。残陽神の加護がありますように。","source_cn":"既然这样……这些曜砂草，你拿走吧。残阳神保佑，祝她早日康复。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF4F0E9E4F9D431C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"情に訴えよう。","source_cn":"动之以情","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6C1FFD0B0398E957","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"情に訴えよう。","female":"情に訴えましょう。","variant_male_record_index":"63130","variant_female_record_index":"63131","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110526010:1":{"text":"オレはウール族のソーン、今回の戦歌祭の参加者だ……","source_cn":"我是乌尔氏族的索恩，本次战歌节的参赛者。我保证——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD7D285F84C568A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110526011:1":{"text":"薬草を売ってくれるなら、戦歌祭が終わったあとに、十倍にして返すと約束する！","source_cn":"今日你给我这些草药，战歌节结束后，我十倍奉还！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AC02DE81D1C92AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"理論で説得しよう。","source_cn":"晓之以理","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x87A62C9C7EDA5AC9","variant_status":"runtime_ge